#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_environment.rst:62
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| ":guilabel:`Concurrent threads`. Defines the number of threads to use for "
#| "proxy clip generation and transcode jobs. Those jobs will run in the "
#| "background. The value entered is passed to ffmpeg as the :code:`-threads` "
#| "parameter. Increasing this parameter may not have an effect if you have "
#| "changed the proxy encoding settings using :doc:`project settings</"
#| "project_and_asset_management/project_settings/proxy_settings>` to a codec "
#| "that ffmpeg does not do multi-threading on. Multi-threading is supported "
#| "for MPEG-2, MPEG-4, H.264, and VP8."
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Concurrent threads`. Defines the number of threads to use for "
"proxy clip generation and transcode jobs. Those jobs will run in the "
"background. The value entered is passed to ffmpeg as the :code:`-threads` "
"parameter. Increasing this parameter may not have an effect if you have "
"changed the proxy encoding settings using :doc:`project settings </"
"project_and_asset_management/project_settings/proxy_settings>` to a codec "
"that ffmpeg does not do multi-threading on. Multi-threading is supported for "
"MPEG-2, MPEG-4, H.264, and VP8."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Súbežné vlákna`. Definuje počet vlákien, ktoré sa použijú na "
"generovanie proxy klipov a úlohy transkódovania. Tieto úlohy budú bežať na "
"pozadí. Zadaná hodnota sa odovzdá programu ffmpeg ako parameter :code:`-"
"threads`. Zvýšenie tohto parametra nemusí mať žiadny efekt, ak ste zmenili "
"nastavenia kódovania proxy pomocou :doc:`nastavení projektu</"
"project_and_asset_management/project_settings/proxy_settings>` na kodek, "
"ktorý ffmpeg nepodporuje viacvláknové spracovanie. Viacvláknové spracovanie "
"je podporované pre MPEG-2, MPEG-4, H.264 a VP8."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_environment.rst:64
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Use lower CPU priority`. This instructs Kdenlive to lower the "
"priority of the proxy clip generation and transcode jobs. It helps keeping "
"the main UI responsive when proxies are created or clips are being "
"transcoded."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Použiť nižšiu prioritu procesora`. Toto dáva Kdenlive pokyn "
"znížiť prioritu úloh generovania proxy klipov a transkódovania. Pomáha to "
"udržať hlavné používateľské rozhranie pohotové, keď sa vytvárajú proxy alebo "
"sa transkódujú klipy."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_environment.rst:66
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Warn if cached data exceeds`. Add a maximal cache size that "
"Kdenlive checks every two weeks. Kdenlive issues a warning message if the "
"total cached data size exceeds this limit. If you need to purge the cache, "
"use the :doc:`/tips_and_tricks/useful_info/manage_cached_data` feature."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Varovať, ak vyrovnávacia pamäť prekračuje`. Pridajte maximálnu "
"veľkosť vyrovnávacej pamäte, ktorú Kdenlive kontroluje každé dva týždne. "
"Kdenlive vydá varovnú správu, ak celková veľkosť uložených dát v pamäti "
"prekročí tento limit. Ak potrebujete vyčistiť vyrovnávaciu pamäť, použite "
"funkciu :doc:`/tips_and_tricks/useful_info/manage_cached_data`."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_environment.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Show welcome screen at startup`. If checked, Kdenlive will show "
"the :ref:`welcome screen <welcome_and_splash_screen>` on which you can "
"select a project. When unchecked, Kdenlive will show the :ref:`splash screen "
"<welcome_and_splash_screen>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Zobraziť uvítaciu obrazovku pri spustení`. Ak je zaškrtnuté, "
"Kdenlive zobrazí :ref:`uvítaciu obrazovku <welcome_and_splash_screen>`, na "
"ktorej môžete vybrať projekt. Ak nie je zaškrtnuté, Kdenlive zobrazí :ref:"
"`úvodnú obrazovku <welcome_and_splash_screen>`."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_environment.rst:70
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Check for updates`. If checked, Kdenlive will show a pop-up "
"window with a reminder if your version is older than six (6) months."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kontrolovať aktualizácie`. Ak je zaškrtnuté, Kdenlive zobrazí "
"vyskakovacie okno s upozornením, ak je vaša verzia staršia ako šesť (6) "
"mesiacov."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_environment.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Prevent sleep when playing and rendering`. If checked, Kdenlive "
"disables the system's power management to avoid sleep mode and screen "
"locking during playback and rendering."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Zabrániť spánku pri prehrávaní a renderovaní`. Ak je zaškrtnuté, "
"Kdenlive zakáže správu napájania systému, aby sa predišlo režimu spánku a "
"uzamknutiu obrazovky počas prehrávania a renderovania."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_environment.rst:74
msgid "Tabs for the different environment settings."
msgstr "Karty pre rôzne nastavenia prostredia."

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_environment.rst:80
msgid "MLT Environment"
msgstr "Prostredie MLT"

#: ../../getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_environment.rst:84
msgid ""
"These settings tell Kdenlive where to find the MLT executables and profile "
"files. Only advanced users would really need to change these settings. "
"Kdenlive is basically a frontend to the MLT program. Since Kdenlive version "
"25.08, |mediainfo| is not needed anymore as Kdenlive can read the timecode "
"directly from MLT and shows these details in the clip properties. The values "
"differ depending on your OS."
msgstr ""
"Tieto nastavenia hovoria Kdenlive, kde nájsť spustiteľné súbory MLT a súbory "
"profilov. Tieto nastavenia by skutočne potrebovali meniť len pokročilí "
"používatelia. Kdenlive je v podstate front-end k programu MLT. Od verzie "
"Kdenlive 25.08 |mediainfo| už nie je potrebný, pretože Kdenlive dokáže čítať "
"časový kód priamo z MLT a zobrazuje tieto podrobnosti vo vlastnostiach "
"klipu. Hodnoty sa líšia v závislosti od vášho operačného systému."

